<title>USA: Material Sciences sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Material Sciences sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material Sciences Corp said Friday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>As of December 12, the company, a manufacturer of continuously processed specialty coated materials and services, had 15.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
